    (com.ftzahao.kisstranslator / com.ftzahao.kisstranslator.extension) embed
    the resulting extension bundle.
  - Distribution packaging (DMG/ZIP), CI workflows and documentation are new.

  None of these modifications change the translation behaviour of the
  extension or remove any upstream functionality.

